# MIKFAST Design Rule — Reuse First

When implementing Router Hub, wizard, switcher, or any new UI: **extend the existing design system**. Do not introduce new libraries, design tokens, or custom components unless listed in "Allowed new classes" below.

## Source of truth

| Layer | File | Use for |
|-------|------|---------|
| Theme base | `css/mikhmon-ui.{dark,light,...}.min.css` | Colors, `.btn`, `.bg-*`, grid `.col-*`, `.navbar`, `.sidenav` |
| Overrides | `css/mikhmon-custom.css` | All `mm-*` components, theme-light fixes, breakpoints |
| Patterns | `include/dashboard-header.php`, `dashboard/home.php` | Page headers, KPI cards, layout |
| Interactions | `js/mikhmon/ui-confirm.js`, `js/mikhmon/ui-toast.js`, `include/menu.php` | confirm, toast, session switch |

Read surrounding page before adding markup. Match PHP + HTML patterns already in that folder.

## Component inventory (use these, don't reinvent)

```
Layout:     .row  .col-4|.col-6|.col-8|.col-12
Surface:    .card  .card-header  .card-body  .card-title  .box
Form:       .form-control  .table (label|input rows)  .input-group
Buttons:    .btn  .btn-sm  .bg-danger  .bg-secondary  .mm-btn-ghost
Actions:    .mm-action-btn  .mm-action-btn--danger
Status:     .mm-chip  .mm-chip--ok  .mm-chip--muted
Header:     .mm-dashheader  .mm-dashheader__title  .mm-dashheader__meta
Sidebar:    .mm-sidenav-header  .mm-sidenav-brand  .mm-sidenav-sub
KPI/stats:  .mm-kpi  .mm-kpi__value  .mm-kpi__label  .mm-kpi__icon
Loading:    .mm-loaderbar  #mmPageSkeleton  body.mm-switching
Feedback:   mikhmon_toast()  mikhmon_confirm()  .alert .alert-success|.alert-warning
Icons:      Font Awesome 4 (`fa fa-*`) only — no new icon set
i18n:       $_* keys via existing lang files — no hardcoded user strings
Spacing:    reuse existing padding in card-body (16px) and card-header patterns
Radius:     already global — .card/.box 14px, .btn/.form-control 12px — don't override
```

## Hard rules

1. **No new CSS framework** — no Tailwind, Bootstrap upgrade, Vue/React UI lib.
2. **No random colors** — never `$color[rand()]` or inline `style="background:#..."`. Use `.card`/`.box` neutral surfaces + `.mm-chip` for status.
3. **No new confirm/toast** — always `mikhmon_confirm()` and `mikhmon_toast()`.
4. **Theme-aware** — every new visual rule needs `body.theme-light` counterpart if it sets background/border/color (copy pattern from `.mm-confirm`, `.mm-toast`, `.mm-lang-dropdown`).
5. **Mobile tap targets** — interactive icons/buttons min ~44px via padding (`.mm-action-btn` pattern), not smaller raw `<i onclick>`.
6. **CSS variables** — prefer `var(--mm-sidenav-w)`, `var(--primary)`, `var(--mm-accent)` over hardcoded px/colors.
7. **Asset cache** — new JS/CSS must load with `mikhmon_asset_ver()` (see `include/headhtml.php`).
8. **Minimal new CSS** — if existing class works, use it. New rules go in `mikhmon-custom.css` with `mm-` prefix only.

## Allowed new classes (Router Hub scope only)

Add only if no existing class fits:

| Class | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `.mm-router-card` | Router hub card layout (flex header/body/actions) |
| `.mm-router-card__name` | Display name typography |
| `.mm-router-card__meta` | Secondary info (model, ROS) — mirror `.mm-sidenav-sub` |
| `.mm-router-switcher` | Panel container — extend `.mm-lang-dropdown__menu` styles |
| `.mm-router-switcher__item` | List row — extend `.mm-lang-dropdown__item` |
| `.mm-wizard-steps` | Step indicator (dots or 1-2-3 text) |
| `.mm-wizard-step` | Single step visibility toggle |

Max ~80 lines new CSS total for Router Hub feature. If exceeding, refactor to reuse more existing classes.

## Layout breakpoints (don't invent new ones)

Use existing breakpoints only:
- `max-width: 750px` — mobile stack
- `751px–1024px` — tablet (collapsible nav, 2-col KPI)
- `max-width: 480px` — form label stack (`.mm-user-form-row`)
- `max-width: 1100px` — panel stack

## Page structure template

```php
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-12">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h3 class="card-title"><i class="fa fa-server"></i> <?= $_routers ?></h3>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <!-- content -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

## Anti-patterns (never do)

```php
<!-- BAD: random bg, raw onclick icon, native confirm -->
<div class="box <?= $color[rand(1,11)] ?>">
  <i class="fa fa-trash" onclick="if(confirm('?'))...">

<!-- GOOD: neutral card, semantic button, themed confirm -->
<div class="card mm-router-card">
  <button type="button" class="mm-action-btn mm-action-btn--danger"
    aria-label="Hapus" onclick="mikhmon_confirm('...', fn)">
```

## Before merging UI changes

- [ ] Works in dark + light theme (`body.theme-light`)
- [ ] Works at 390px, 820px, 1280px width
- [ ] No new npm/CDN dependencies
- [ ] i18n keys added for all user-visible strings
- [ ] `graphify update .` after PHP/JS changes
